          <text class="hg-t-lab hg-f-potok" x="325" y="764" text-anchor="middle">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "live and push")}
          </text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <figcaption>
        {dgettext(
          "help_guides",
          "The app's work is teal, Potok's blue, a process's purple, and people are in the color of the text. The yellow part of a bar means the instance waits for a person, the gray one that it waits for the process it called. The app sees the drawing at no step, and the Repairer hands back to the report only the entity Termin, whose note the manager writes with the decision."
        )}
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="hg-section">
    <h2>{dgettext("help_guides", "Processes among themselves")}</h2>
    <p>
      {dgettext(
        "help_guides",
        "A process talks to another process only by a step drawn for it, a call or a signal. What a process writes, a message or a sub-group, starts no process, so two processes cannot spin in a circle by accident."
      )}
    </p>
    <figure id="hg-fig-calls" class="hg-fig" style="--hg-min: 640px; --hg-max: 900px">
      <div class="hg-swipe">{dgettext("help_guides", "The picture scrolls left and right.")}</div>
      <div class="hg-scroll">
        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 880 470"
          role="img"
          aria-label={
            dgettext(
              "help_guides",
              "A tree of groups: the public process Repairer in Zgrada Cvetna 12 is called by processes of the group above and of the group below, but not of the neighboring building. A message a process writes does not start another process."
            )
          }
        >
          <line class="hg-edge" x1="450" y1="50" x2="450" y2="86" />
          <path class="hg-edge" d="M450 158 V184 H250 V222" />
          <path class="hg-edge" d="M450 184 H680 V222" />
          <line class="hg-edge" x1="170" y1="318" x2="170" y2="370" />

          <rect class="hg-node-root" x="380" y="14" width="140" height="36" rx="18" />
          <text class="hg-t-row hg-f-potok" x="450" y="37" text-anchor="middle">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "Root")}
          </text>

          <rect class="hg-node" x="300" y="86" width="300" height="72" rx="12" />
          <text class="hg-t-row" x="316" y="108">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "Local community")}
          </text>
          <rect class="hg-chip-proc" x="316" y="120" width="170" height="26" rx="13" />
          <text class="hg-t-chip hg-f-proc" x="401" y="137" text-anchor="middle">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "Yearly check")}
          </text>

          <rect class="hg-node" x="60" y="222" width="380" height="96" rx="12" />
          <text class="hg-t-row" x="76" y="244">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "Zgrada Cvetna 12")}
          </text>
          <rect class="hg-chip-proc" x="76" y="258" width="136" height="26" rx="13" />
          <text class="hg-t-chip hg-f-proc" x="144" y="275" text-anchor="middle">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "Reporting a fault")}
          </text>
          <rect class="hg-chip-pub" x="272" y="258" width="152" height="26" rx="13" />
          <text class="hg-t-chip hg-f-proc" x="348" y="275" text-anchor="middle">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "Repairer · public")}
          </text>
          <text class="hg-t-sub" x="76" y="306">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "a group field stays here; a signal, if asked")}
          </text>

          <rect class="hg-node" x="520" y="222" width="320" height="72" rx="12" />
          <text class="hg-t-row" x="536" y="244">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "Zgrada Cvetna 14")}
          </text>
          <rect class="hg-chip-proc" x="536" y="256" width="136" height="26" rx="13" />
          <text class="hg-t-chip hg-f-proc" x="604" y="273" text-anchor="middle">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "Reporting a fault")}
          </text>

          <rect class="hg-node" x="140" y="370" width="260" height="68" rx="12" />
          <text class="hg-t-row" x="156" y="392">{dgettext("help_guides", "Entrance A")}</text>
          <rect class="hg-chip-proc" x="156" y="404" width="110" height="26" rx="13" />
          <text class="hg-t-chip hg-f-proc" x="211" y="421" text-anchor="middle">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "Lift")}
          </text>

          <line
            class="hg-ar hg-s-proc"
            x1="212"
            y1="271"
            x2="272"
            y2="271"
            marker-end="url(#hg-m-proc)"
          />
          <text class="hg-t-lab hg-f-proc" x="241" y="265" text-anchor="middle">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "calls")}
          </text>
          <path
            class="hg-ar hg-s-proc"
            d="M401 146 C401 196 348 206 348 258"
            marker-end="url(#hg-m-proc)"
          />
          <text class="hg-t-lab hg-f-proc" x="408" y="208">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "calls from above: may")}
          </text>
          <path
            class="hg-ar hg-s-proc"
            d="M211 404 C211 352 348 338 348 284"
            marker-end="url(#hg-m-proc)"
          />
          <text class="hg-t-lab hg-f-proc" x="300" y="356">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "calls from below: may")}
          </text>
          <line
            class="hg-ar hg-s-muted hg-dash"
            x1="536"
            y1="270"
            x2="424"
            y2="270"
            marker-end="url(#hg-m-muted)"
          />
          <line class="hg-x-mark" x1="475" y1="264" x2="487" y2="276" />
          <line class="hg-x-mark" x1="475" y1="276" x2="487" y2="264" />
          <text class="hg-t-lab hg-f-muted" x="481" y="308" text-anchor="middle">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "from the side: no")}
          </text>

          <rect class="hg-node" x="520" y="330" width="320" height="126" rx="12" />
          <text class="hg-t-row" x="536" y="352">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "What a process writes starts no process")}
          </text>
          <rect class="hg-chip-proc" x="536" y="366" width="110" height="26" rx="13" />
          <text class="hg-t-chip hg-f-proc" x="591" y="383" text-anchor="middle">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "Process A")}
          </text>
          <line
            class="hg-ar hg-s-proc"
            x1="646"
            y1="379"
            x2="694"
            y2="379"
            marker-end="url(#hg-m-proc)"
          />
          <text class="hg-t-lab hg-f-proc" x="670" y="373" text-anchor="middle">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "writes")}
          </text>
          <rect class="hg-chip-potok" x="694" y="366" width="130" height="26" rx="8" />
          <text class="hg-t-chip hg-f-potok" x="759" y="383" text-anchor="middle">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "message “fault…”")}
          </text>
          <line
            class="hg-ar hg-s-muted hg-dash"
            x1="759"
            y1="392"
            x2="759"
            y2="424"
            marker-end="url(#hg-m-muted)"
          />
          <line class="hg-x-mark" x1="753" y1="402" x2="765" y2="414" />
          <line class="hg-x-mark" x1="753" y1="414" x2="765" y2="402" />
          <text class="hg-t-lab hg-f-muted" x="772" y="412">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "does not start")}
          </text>
          <rect class="hg-chip-proc" x="694" y="424" width="130" height="26" rx="13" />
          <text class="hg-t-chip hg-f-proc" x="759" y="441" text-anchor="middle">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "Process B")}
          </text>
          <text class="hg-t-sub" x="536" y="441">
            {dgettext("help_guides", "B starts on the word “fault”")}
          </text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <figcaption>
        {dgettext(
          "help_guides",
          "The Repairer is public, so processes of the groups above Zgrada Cvetna 12 and of the groups below it call it. The neighboring branch, Zgrada Cvetna 14, cannot. A private process is called only by its own group. A group field does not leave the group. A signal reaches the groups above and below only where a wait or a start says it hears them, never the neighboring branch, and a call made from a call goes at most %{depth} deep. To a caller from another group the Repairer hands only the Termin and the name of the end it reached. The groups around Zgrada Cvetna 12 and the processes A and B are made up for this picture.",
          depth: @f.max_depth
        )}
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="hg-section">
    <h2>{dgettext("help_guides", "Where each one stops")}</h2>
    <div class="hg-limits">
      <div class="hg-l-app">
        <h3>{dgettext("help_guides", "App")}</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>
            {dgettext(
              "help_guides",
              "It writes only into its own collections. It reads other apps' values only outside collections, and another app's collection never."
            )}
          </li>
          <li>
            <.hg_text text={
              dgettext(
                "help_guides",
                "It makes and changes groups only for a viewer who may edit, and only right below its own. The exception is a place on the map (`createPlace`): for that the permission to make sub-groups is enough."
              )
            } />
          </li>
          <li>
            {dgettext(
              "help_guides",
              "It does not see the drawings of processes, does not vote and does not change a poll."
            )}
          </li>
          <li>{dgettext("help_guides", "For a guest it only reads.")}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="hg-l-proc">
        <h3>{dgettext("help_guides", "Process")}</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>
            {dgettext(
              "help_guides",
              "It writes in its own group and in the sub-groups it made itself, as far as the permissions there let it."
            )}
          </li>
          <li>
            {dgettext(
              "help_guides",
              "It sends a push to a role only with the right to mention roles."
            )}
          </li>
          <li>
            {dgettext(
              "help_guides",
              "It gives or takes no role itself. Its Poll step puts that to the group, saying how unique and shared profiles vote, and the decision does it as the poll ends; in a group run by its founders only while its owner is an Admin."
            )}
          </li>
          <li>
            {dgettext(
              "help_guides",
              "It decides no request to join or for a role: that is for whoever manages requests, or for a vote."
            )}
          </li>
          <li>
            {dgettext(
              "help_guides",
              "At most %{run} steps in a row without waiting, %{steps} in its whole life and %{writes} writes a minute.",
              run: @f.max_run,
              steps: @f.max_steps,
              writes: @f.process_writes
            )}
          </li>
          <li>
            {dgettext("help_guides", "A loop goes through at most %{items} items.",
              items: @f.max_items
            )}
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="hg-l-potok">
        <h3>{dgettext("help_guides", "Potok")}</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>
            {dgettext("help_guides", "It checks every call again, whatever the app asked for.")}
          </li>
          <li>
            {dgettext(
              "help_guides",
              "An instance carries a copy of the drawing, so a change holds only for new instances."
            )}
          </li>
          <li>
            {dgettext(
              "help_guides",
              "Every step goes in its own transaction, so what it writes happens once."
            )}
          </li>
          <li>
            {dgettext("help_guides", "From a process nobody learns who wrote an anonymous value.")}
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <:sources>
    <.hg_text
      text={
        dgettext(
          "help_guides",
          "The rules are copied from the <a1>domain map</a1> and from the code."
        )
      }
      links={%{"a1" => ~p"/domain"}}
    />
  </:sources>
</.help_guide_frame>
